  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing solutions for closing the yield gap in smallholder oil palm p</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Yield Gap Atlas Phase II, Developing solutions for closing the yiled gap in smallholder oil palm plantation in Indonesia. The objective is to increase oil palm yield in smallholders plantation, and forest and peatlands are protected from further conversion into oil palm plantation.</narrative>
  </description>
